{
  "$comment": "Per-category defaults. Not a JSON Schema: it is the table the detectors and the status rules (issue #18) read. defaultCertainty is what a detector emits unless its detection path says otherwise, and certaintyMayVary marks the categories where that is legitimate. defaultSeverity is the starting point for severity; a detector may raise it with a documented reason but must not silently lower it. tools/validate-schemas.mjs fails if this table and the category enum disagree, so a new category cannot be added without deciding these values.",
